</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The sun gives us light, warms us just right.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The moon shining bright lights up the night.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The stars stay right where God put them there.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The earth turns and tips on yearly trips</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>God planned it this way: night and then day!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
